on":"chapter-041","block":"b-05065728d211baad4f67","layer":"original","quote":"峻城中兵才数百人，伺其怠隙，选精锐出击；大破之，即斩存首","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":109,"end":137},{"id":"huowang-q-25570f0a1133828da972","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e86cc02d33414924d51a","layer":"original","quote":"笃卒，荆州牧刘表令峻摄其众","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":44},{"id":"huowang-q-26ab48f3dbe23343dffd","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-0cd7f4f59c0ff2b5b1e8","layer":"original","quote":"先主定蜀，嘉峻之功；乃分广汉为梓潼郡，以峻为梓潼太守、裨将军","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"huowang-q-3eac364ea7e991b3dec0","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-05065728d211baad4f67","layer":"original","quote":"表卒，峻率众归先主","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9},{"id":"huowang-q-401b7da0781c40c580f1","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-3c1df4ff8f541f727983","layer":"original","quote":"在官三年，年四十卒。还葬成都","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"huowang-q-45c2ca0bd3301836ef44","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-05065728d211baad4f67","layer":"original","quote":"先主以峻为中郎将","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":10,"end":18},{"id":"huowang-q-64af9e2fa2b646eac332","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-05065728d211baad4f67","layer":"original","quote":"后璋将扶禁、向存等帅万余人，由阆水上〖2〗，攻围峻；且一年〖3〗，不能下","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":108},{"id":"huowang-q-98c8a6d8b0387a8d9af5","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-3c1df4ff8f541f727983","layer":"original","quote":"先主甚悼惜，乃诏诸葛亮曰：“峻既佳士，加有功于国，欲行酹〖4〗。”遂亲率群僚临会吊祭，因留宿墓上","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":63},{"id":"huowang-q-a085f159439635932339","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-05065728d211baad4f67","layer":"original","quote":"先主自葭萌南还袭刘璋，留峻守葭萌城","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":36},{"id":"huowang-q-b3a878b1027decc82889","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-05065728d211baad4f67","layer":"original","quote":"张鲁遣将杨帛诱峻，求共守城。峻曰：“小人头可得，城不可得！”帛乃退去","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":37,"end":71},{"id":"liuermu-q-4d23bb4578b63b8f2031","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-9368771bcb03c6644bf6","layer":"original","quote":"还兵南向〖25〗，所在皆克","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":26},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o041a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c205af65c5b891e6a027","layer":"original","quote":"先主大怒，召璋白水军督杨怀，责以无礼，斩之。乃使黄忠、卓膺勒兵向璋〖9〗。先主径至关中〖10〗，质诸将并士卒妻子〖11〗；引兵与忠、膺等进到涪，据其城。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o039","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-3fc74e22c633afc483a4","layer":"original","quote":"明年，曹公征孙权，权呼先主自救〖4〗。先主遣使告璋曰：“曹公征吴，吴忧危急；孙氏与孤，本为唇齿。又乐进在青泥与关羽相拒〖5〗；今不往救羽，进必大克；转侵州界〖6〗，其忧有甚于鲁。鲁，自守之贼，不足虑也。”乃从璋求万兵及资（宝）〔实〕〖7〗，欲以东行。璋但许兵四千，其余皆给半。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141}],"profiles":{"huowang-p0032":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
